OL,4,BIordanescu ready for Watford           
OL,5,B'challenge'                            
OL,6,GNew Watford boss Edward Iordanescu     
OL,7,Gsays he has inherited a "challenge"    
OL,8,Gbut also "an opportunity" as the club  
OL,9,Gseeks to pull away from the            
OL,10,GChampionship relegation zone.          
OL,12,FThe 48-year-old has replaced Alessio   
OL,13,FDionisi, who was sacked on Sunday      
OL,14,Fafter only five months in charge,      
OL,15,Ffollowing a run of seven defeats in 10 
OL,16,Fleague games.                          
OL,18,FIordanescu became Watford's sixth new  
OL,19,Fboss in less than 18 months and is the 
OL,20,F25th manager since the Pozzo family    
OL,21,Ftook over the club in 2012.            
